        "original_id": "3f9e8cdb-1b5a-5ed2-95db-02902d2b24fa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Elmadi Zhabrailov, Lukman Zhabrailov, Kevin Jackson, Cael Sanderson\n- Organizations: Iowa State University, Penn State University\n- Events: 1992 Olympics\n- Roles: wrestling coach\n\nFacts:\n- Lukman Zhabrailov, the elder brother of Elmadi Zhabrailov, prepared Elmadi Zhabrailov for the 1992 Olympics.\n- At the 1992 Olympics, Elmadi Zhabrailov won a silver medal after losing the final bout to Kevin Jackson by a controversial decision.\n- In 2009, Iowa State University hired Kevin Jackson as head wrestling coach after Cael Sanderson moved to Penn State University.\n- After retiring from active competition, Kevin Jackson became the head wrestling coach at Iowa State University.",
